6. Cross and Polynomial Features:  
   - Combine CreditScore and PriorDefault (CreditScore × PriorDefault) to evaluate default-adjusted creditworthiness.  
   - Multiply log_income × industry_income_mean for sector-adjusted income.  

These transformations will highlight financial responsibility, sector trends, and demographic influences critical for predicting credit card application success.

